          "Text": "Wave pushes the picture back and forth along a wave, so the flag's straight bands ripple like cloth. Rotation is a quarter turn, so the wave runs across the flag, and the Master Gear moves its Phase one wave a loop. Turn Amplitude and Frequency, or try Mode Radial with Displacement Ripple."
        }
      },
